Subject: [PATCH 39/76] v2 P.1 host-embed fix (Astra P1-R2 findings 1-3 + dtype
 contract): loader opt-out from device_loading_context so the pinned shard the
 UVA view aliases is never moved or replaced, TP1 stock lookup semantics,
 fixed-dtype refusal on parent dtype transforms, measured-allocation
 provisioning note (Sol draft, Fable applied/tested)

QuantizeMethodBase.requires_device_loading defaults True (all other methods unchanged); _PinnedHostUnquantizedEmbeddingMethod sets False and process_weights_after_loading calls its hook without the context. Apply note: base-class attribute placed after the existing attribute docstrings (Sol draft split a docstring).

Tests: tests/models/qwen4_exp/test_host_uva_embedding.py 16 passed + U5 budget report skipped (torch 2.13 host_memory_stats exposes no byte keys). Red on 49dbdb50da, all behavioural: outer post-load peak CUDA growth 1048576 == table bytes (transient), TP1 contract, dtype move did not raise, provisioning note absent.
